a centers and vital apps to AWS, including Oracle ERP. With AWS\u0027s guidance, they slashed downtime, improved Oracle performance by 20%, and saw a 400% rise in developer productivity.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/World_Kinect%20LOGO%401X.d1511ce8c20faa37b62276ed31193a106e3774ee.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"world kinect corporation","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Power \u0026 Utilities","sortDate":"2024-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/world-kinect-services-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"World Kinect Corporation","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"World Kinect Boosts Application Performance, Drives Infrastructure Resiliency, and Modernizes Applications by Collaborating with AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#migration-transfer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","description":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#efs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic File System (EFS)","description":"Amazon Elastic File System (EFS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Migration","description":"Migration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId