{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"By running its geospatial data platform on AWS, Bayer Crop Science quickly scales to meet growth, provisions compute and storage in seconds, and sets up development and test environments in minutes instead of months. Bayer Crop Science provides agricultural products that support farmers and other customers throughout the world.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/BayerCropScience_Customer-Reference_Logo.5c397f30902a323a26d59af8d39d8196f059023b.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy running its geospatial data platform on AWS, Bayer Crop Science quickly scales to meet growth, provisions compute and storage in seconds, and sets up development and test environments in minutes instead of months. Bayer Crop Science provides agricultural products that support farmers and other customers throughout the world.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Agriculture","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/bayer-crop-science-EFS/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Monsanto","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Bayer Crop Science EFS Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en